# Townsfolk peoples, 2026-10-26. Standing pose, 11x16, feet on the ground, flat colors like the
# existing townsfolk (folk-human, folk-elf, folk-horned). Every sprite has a top outline.
# Canon (_dev/docs/cast-and-peoples.md): every people exists; a townsperson never reads as an
# enemy, so no lizard shapes and no goblin, kobold or Ashen Orc colors.

